  "description": "Two brothers lose http://anidb.net/ch7784 [their mother] to an incurable disease. With the power of alchemy, they use taboo knowledge to resurrect her. The process fails, and as a toll for using this type of alchemy, the older brother, http://anidb.net/ch5885 [Edward Elric], loses his left leg while the younger brother, http://anidb.net/ch5908 [Alphonse Elric], loses his entire body. To save his brother, Edward sacrifices his right arm and is able to affix his brother\`s soul to a suit of armor. With the help of http://anidb.net/ch10164 [a family friend], Edward receives metal limbs - automail - to replace his lost ones. With that, Edward vows to search for the Philosopher\`s Stone to return the brothers to their original bodies, even if it means becoming a State Alchemist, one who uses their alchemy for the military.
Source: ANN",
